  "description": "The ultimate old school cruiser, our Boardwalk is designed with a comfortable upright riding position perfect getting around town, exploring bikes paths, or even a trip to the beach. It's lightweight, and well-appointed with components meant to last, which also makes it an excellent choice for use at resorts and rental fleets. The Boardwalk is available as a single or seven-speed and comes in a variety of sizes and colors.\nLightweight 6061 alloy frame\nAvailable as a single speed with Shimano coaster brake or seven speed w/linear-pull brakes (in limited colors)\nAlloy crankset and chainring with sealed cartridge bottom bracket\nKMC EPT treatment chain with maximum rust resistance\nAlloy rims with heavy duty 12g stainless steel spokes\n24\" or 26\" x 2.125\" cruiser tires\nComfort Cruiser steel handlebar with inner foam protection\nSunlite Cloud-9 XL cruiser saddle\nSteel chain guard\nAlloy kickstand",
